  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>You summon a writhing mass of energy in a dragonlike form, a three-dimensional projection of your dragonmark. A living dragonmark appears where you designate within the spell’s range. Aberrant mark summons gains the Negative trait, while true mark summons gains the Positive trait.</p>\n\n\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> the level of the @UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-creatures.xcYCNgYm5HXMJiOd]{Greater Living Dragonmark} summoned increases by 2. Its AC, DCs, and Saves increase by the equivalent amount.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> If you have a Siberys mark, you summon a @UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-creatures.wijPvhyDjH8VHprE]{Siberys Living Dragonmark} instead of a Greater Living Dragonmark</p>\n"
    },
